    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434880/extras/62a625f8de9a184b79f4fa80356f34d4.avif?t=1753023152\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2301 Incoming transmission to Earth! \u2301</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I'm MAXCYBER. ROBO OH is an FC-style robots fighting game. Play as more than 12 great robots in a grand tournament to declare the king. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A modernized fighting system is combined with a retro control scheme. Perform simple or advanced combos to uncover each robot's full potential. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I'm waiting for your fight! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434880/extras/a2d79b6f5c05a49387f0ce1edf40ca0b.avif?t=1753023152\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More Than 12 Playable Robots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">VS, Arcade, Endless, Training modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All-Original Graphics And Sound</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden Characters And Special Boss Events</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434880/extras/890b3e198544d6a66c3d2214957392b6.avif?t=1753023152\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434880/extras/62a625f8de9a184b79f4fa80356f34d4.avif?t=1753023152\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2301 Incoming transmission to Earth! \u2301</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I'm MAXCYBER. ROBO OH is an FC-style robots fighting game. Play as more than 12 great robots in a grand tournament to declare the king. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A modernized fighting system is combined with a retro control scheme. Perform simple or advanced combos to uncover each robot's full potential. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I'm waiting for your fight! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434880/extras/a2d79b6f5c05a49387f0ce1edf40ca0b.avif?t=1753023152\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More Than 12 Playable Robots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">VS, Arcade, Endless, Training modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All-Original Graphics And Sound</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden Characters And Special Boss Events</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434880/extras/890b3e198544d6a66c3d2214957392b6.avif?t=1753023152\" /></div></p>",
